sy cycling, swimming or yoga |\n| Sun | Rest | \u2013 |\n\n**Progression rule:** Add 2\u20135\u202f% weight to dumbbell lifts each week if you can complete the top rep range with good form; for bodyweight work, increase reps or hold time by 1\u20132 each session. Every 4th week, reduce volume by 20\u202f% (deload).\n\n**Busy\u2011week fallback (if you can\u2019t fit a full session):** Do the Thursday bodyweight circuit twice (morning\u202f+\u202fevening) and the Friday circuit once; skip optional Saturday activity.\n\nDo you have any injuries, pain points, or other limitations I should know about before finalising the plan?",
