 or mobility routine (10\u201115\u202fmin) |\n| Sun | Rest | \u2014 |\n\n**Progression rule:**\u202fFor dumbbell days, add\u202f\u22485\u202f% weight or 1\u20112 reps each week if you completed all reps with good form. For bodyweight days, aim for +2 reps per set or add a more challenging variation (e.g., decline push\u2011ups \u2192 feet\u2011elevated). If you feel overly fatigued, drop the last accessory set.\n\n**Busy\u2011week fallback (if time runs short):**\u202fDo a 20\u2011minute \u201cfull\u2011body circuit\u201d \u2013 1\u202fmin each of push\u2011ups, air squats, pull\u2011ups (or rows), lunges, and plank, repeat 3\u202ftimes.\n\nDo you have any current injuries or movement limitations I should keep in mind while tweaking the plan?",
